/*
  PowerOutputChart.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0158 · PowerOutputChart (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `PowerOutputChart` resolves (table "PowerOutputChart") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/PowerOutputChart.tsx). The remainder
  back the data-export columns, the native state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity
  banner, loading / empty / error chrome), the toggle-legend affordance, and the chart
  axes / accessibility summaries.
*/

